\pard\plain \fi720\qj\hyphpar1\sb0\sa0 \f4\fs24 \cs65552\f4\fs24 {\cs26\b1\cf17 \b1\cf17 Примечания.} 1. В настоящей статье под деятельностью, направленной против безопасности Российской Федерации, понимается совершение хотя бы одного из преступлений, предусмотренных {\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK \\l "sub_189"}}{\fldrslt {\cs24\b0\cf18 статьями 189}}}, {\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK \\l "sub_100000016"}}{\fldrslt {\cs24\b0\cf18 200.1}}}, {\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK \\l "sub_2073"}}{\fldrslt {\cs24\b0\cf18 207.3}}}, {\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK \\l "sub_209"}}{\fldrslt {\cs24\b0\cf18 209}}}, {\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK \\l "sub_210"}}{\fldrslt {\cs24\b0\cf18 210}}}, {\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK \\l "sub_222"}}{\fldrslt {\cs24\b0\cf18 222 - 223.1}}}, {\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK \\l "sub_226"}}{\fldrslt {\cs24\b0\cf18 226}}}, {\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK \\l "sub_2261"}}{\fldrslt {\cs24\b0\cf18 226.1}}}, {\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK \\l "sub_2291"}}{\fldrslt {\cs24\b0\cf18 229.1}}}, {\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK \\l "sub_2741"}}{\fldrslt {\cs24\b0\cf18 274.1}}}, {\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK \\l "sub_275"}}{\fldrslt {\cs24\b0\cf18 275 - 276.1}}}, {\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK \\l "sub_2803"}}{\fldrslt {\cs24\b0\cf18 280.3}}}, {\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK \\l "sub_281"}}{\fldrslt {\cs24\b0\cf18 281 - 281.3}}}, {\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK \\l "sub_283"}}{\fldrslt {\cs24\b0\cf18 283}}}, {\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK \\l "sub_2831"}}{\fldrslt {\cs24\b0\cf18 283.1}}}, {\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK \\l "sub_2841"}}{\fldrslt {\cs24\b0\cf18 284.1 - 284.3}}}, {\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK \\l "sub_290"}}{\fldrslt {\cs24\b0\cf18 290}}}, {\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK \\l "sub_291"}}{\fldrslt {\cs24\b0\cf18 291}}}, {\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK \\l "sub_322"}}{\fldrslt {\cs24\b0\cf18 322}}}, {\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK \\l "sub_32201"}}{\fldrslt {\cs24\b0\cf18 322.1}}}, {\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK \\l "sub_323"}}{\fldrslt {\cs24\b0\cf18 323}}}, {\field{\*\fldinst {